{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"SwiftOptimize"}],"title":"Hyperparameter Tuning & AutoML Engine","role":"article"},"abstract":[{"text":"Automate model exploration and parameter optimization with ","type":"text"},{"code":"GridSearchCV","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"RandomizedSearchCV","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and the intelligent ","type":"text"},{"code":"AutoML","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" model selector.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Guides & Tutorials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/CrossValidationFolds","doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/ParallelModelSelection"],"anchor":"Guides--Tutorials","generated":true}],"kind":"article","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/hyperparametertuning"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Finding the optimal combination of hyperparameters is critical for maximizing generalization accuracy. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftOptimize"},{"text":" provides exhaustive grid search, randomized sampling for high-dimensional parameter spaces, and end-to-end ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AutoML"},{"text":" selection across multiple model families.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"1. AutoML — Automated Model Selection","anchor":"1-AutoML-Automated-Model-Selection","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AutoML"},{"text":" cross-validates a fixed set of baseline architectures (Logistic\/Linear Regression, Decision Tree, Random Forest, MLP) and ranks them by the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"mean per-fold","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" score: macro F1 for classification, R² for regression. Classification uses ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/StratifiedKFold","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"; regression uses shuffled ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/KFold","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". All metrics come from ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/EvaluationHarness","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import Foundation","import SwiftOptimize","import SwiftML","","\/\/ 1. Synthetic classification dataset","let N = 120","let D = 4","let X = (0..<N).map { i in","    (0..<D).map { d in Double(i * D + d) * 0.05 + sin(Double(i + d)) }","}","let y = (0..<N).map { i in Double(i % 2) }","","\/\/ 2. Configure AutoML with 3-fold stratified cross-validation","let autoML = AutoML(","    timeBudgetSeconds: 30,","    taskType: .classification,","    nFolds: 3,","    seed: 42",")","","\/\/ 3. Run model selection","let report = try await autoML.fit(features: X, targets: y)","","print(\"Best model: \\(await autoML.bestModelName ?? \"-\")\")","print(\"CV macro F1: \\(report.metrics[\"cv_score\"]!) ± \\(report.metrics[\"cv_std\"]!)\")","","for entry in await autoML.leaderboard {","    print(entry.displayName, entry.meanScore, entry.foldScores)","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Task type:","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":".auto","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default) classifies integer targets with ≤ 10 distinct values, treats non-integer or high-cardinality targets as regression, and throws ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/AutoMLError\/ambiguousTaskType(uniqueValues:sampleCount:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" in between. Pass ","type":"text"},{"code":"taskType","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" explicitly in that case.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Time budget:","type":"text"}]},{"text":" soft. It is checked before each candidate and fold; a running fit is not interrupted, and the first candidate always completes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Search:","type":"text"}]},{"text":" only ","type":"text"},{"code":".modelSelection","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is available. To tune hyperparameters of a single estimator, use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/GridSearchCV","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/RandomizedSearchCV","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" below.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"2. Exhaustive Grid Search (`GridSearchCV`)","anchor":"2-Exhaustive-Grid-Search-GridSearchCV","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GridSearchCV"},{"text":" exhaustively tests all Cartesian combinations of hyperparameter discrete values.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import SwiftOptimize","import SwiftML","","\/\/ Define hyperparameter search grid for DecisionTreeClassifier","let paramGrid: [String: [Any]] = [","    \"maxDepth\": [3, 5, 8],","    \"minSamplesSplit\": [2, 5, 10],","    \"criterion\": [\"gini\", \"entropy\"]","]","","let gridSearch = GridSearchCV(","    estimator: DecisionTreeClassifier(maxDepth: 3),","    paramGrid: paramGrid,","    cv: 5,","    scoring: .accuracy",")","","try await gridSearch.fit(features: X, targets: y)","","if let bestParams = gridSearch.bestParams {","    print(\"Optimal Depth: \\(bestParams[\"maxDepth\"] ?? \"default\")\")","    print(\"Peak CV Accuracy: \\(String(format: \"%.4f\", gridSearch.bestScore ?? 0.0))\")","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"3. Randomized Search (`RandomizedSearchCV`)","anchor":"3-Randomized-Search-RandomizedSearchCV","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When searching through large continuous or discrete combinatorial spaces, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RandomizedSearchCV"},{"text":" samples $N$ random configurations, finding near-optimal solutions in a fraction of the compute time.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import SwiftOptimize","import SwiftML","","let distributions: [String: [Any]] = [","    \"learningRate\": [0.001, 0.005, 0.01, 0.05, 0.1],","    \"epochs\": [100, 200, 500, 1000],","    \"l2Penalty\": [0.0, 0.0001, 0.001, 0.01]","]","","let randomSearch = RandomizedSearchCV(","    estimator: LogisticRegression(learningRate: 0.01),","    paramDistributions: distributions,","    nIter: 20,","    cv: 3,","    randomSeed: 42",")","","try await randomSearch.fit(features: X, targets: y)","print(\"Top Configuration Score: \\(randomSearch.bestScore ?? 0.0)\")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/HyperparameterTuning","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize"]]},"references":{"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/StratifiedKFold":{"abstract":[{"text":"Stratified K-Fold cross-validator.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Provides train\/validation indices such that class proportions are preserved in each fold."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/StratifiedKFold","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"StratifiedKFold","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/stratifiedkfold","title":"StratifiedKFold","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StratifiedKFold","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/GridSearchCV":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/GridSearchCV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GridSearchCV","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/gridsearchcv","title":"GridSearchCV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GridSearchCV","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Performs parallel Grid Search over a hyperparameter grid for DecisionTreeClassifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to find the best hyperparameter combination via Stratified K-Fold Cross-Validation."}]},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/EvaluationHarness":{"abstract":[{"text":"Unified Classifier & Regressor Evaluation Metrics Harness (G-019).","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/evaluationharness","title":"EvaluationHarness","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/EvaluationHarness","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EvaluationHarness","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EvaluationHarness","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/RandomizedSearchCV":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RandomizedSearchCV"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Performs parallel Randomized Search over random hyperparameter combinations","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"via K-Fold Cross-Validation.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/randomizedsearchcv","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/RandomizedSearchCV","kind":"symbol","title":"RandomizedSearchCV","fragments":[{"text":"struct"